---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro'

const DEMO_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_DEMO_URL || '/demo'
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Founder Narrative — Built by a Healthcare Executive Chef in Maine" 
  description="Why ShorelineOps was forged inside an assisted living kitchen dealing with dysphagia textures, allergen risks, and food distributor ordering."
>
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Editorial Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-shoreline-500/10 border border-shoreline-500/20 text-shoreline-700 dark:text-shoreline-300 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-shoreline-500"></span>
          <span>FOUNDER PERSPECTIVE · DIETARY OPERATIONS</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4 font-display">
          Why I Built ShorelineOps Inside a Real Senior Living Kitchen.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-serif italic border-l-2 border-shoreline-500 pl-4 py-1">
          "Nobody selling healthcare dietary software has ever cooked a pureed dinner service for 80 residents with 14 different allergy restrictions while balancing food cost."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Split Editorial Layout -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Sidebar: Field Intelligence & Profile -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card p-6 shadow-subtle">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">FIELD PRACTITIONER</div>
            <div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display">Executive Chef &amp; Systems Architect</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono mb-4">Portland, Maine · Healthcare Dining</div>
            
            <div class="border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-obsidian-border pt-4 space-y-3 text-xs">
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-slate-50 dark:border-obsidian-border/50">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Facility Scope</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">65–120 Beds</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-slate-50 dark:border-obsidian-border/50">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Active Diets</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">14 Clinical Variants</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-slate-50 dark:border-obsidian-border/50">
                <span class="text-slate-500">HACCP Baseline</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">165°F Cook / 140°F Hold</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Primary Broadline</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Dennis / Sysco Split</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/5 p-6 text-xs text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300">
            <div class="font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2">
              WHY OPEN CORE?
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              When a resident chokes on the wrong texture, it is not an IT ticket—it is a medical emergency. Clinical dining safety, IDDSI compliance, and thermal tray tickets should be a fundamental human right in elder care, not an unaffordable luxury.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Main Body: The Full Narrative -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p>
              If you have ever stepped into a senior living dietary department at 4:30 PM, you know the daily high-stakes reality:
            </p>
            
            <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card p-6 shadow-subtle divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-obsidian-border">
              <div class="pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                  <span>01</span>
                  <span>LAST-MINUTE CLINICAL EHR CHANGES</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Nursing calls down right before tray line with two room transfers, a new physician Low Sodium order, and a resident newly designated strict NPO awaiting swallow evaluation.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="py-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                  <span>02</span>
                  <span>GLOVED KITCHEN ERGONOMICS</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Line cooks with wet nitrile gloves are trying to read faded handwriting on a greasy whiteboard while staging 4 hotel pans of hot entrees under a 165°F heat lamp.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="pt-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                  <span>03</span>
                  <span>CLIPBOARD MRP GUESSWORK</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Building weekly food orders for Dennis Food Service or Sysco using clipboards and guesswork, hoping you don't stock out of thickener or pureed meats before Friday truck delivery.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display">
              The Legacy Software Trap
            </h2>
            <p>
              When evaluating legacy healthcare dining software, independent facilities face a false binary:
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card">
                <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase mb-1">Proprietary Monopolies</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono mb-2">$1,200+/mo · Multi-Year Lock-in</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                  Bloated software engineered in 2004 for 800-bed hospital conglomerates. Requires 6 months of IT onboarding, complex server provisioning, and exclusive distributor contracts.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card">
                <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase mb-1">Paper Binders &amp; Spreadsheets</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono mb-2">$0 · Maximum Survey Risk</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                  What 80% of independent homes actually rely on. Handwritten notes, disconnected recipe sheets, and high anxiety whenever state health inspectors audit CMS F-Tag 812 compliance.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display">
              The ShorelineOps Alternative
            </h2>
            <p>
              We built ShorelineOps as a third way: an open-source, practitioner-designed operating system that runs locally on simple hardware, scales seamlessly to the cloud, and treats clinical safety with mathematical rigor.
            </p>

            <!-- Kiosk Interface Showcase -->
            <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black shadow-elevated">
              <img src="/screenshots/kitchen_tablet_kiosk.png" alt="Shoreline Touch Tablet Kiosk" class="w-full h-auto object-cover opacity-95" />
              <div class="p-3 bg-obsidian-surface border-t border-obsidian-border text-center text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">
                TOUCH TABLET KIOSK · 44PX TOUCH TARGETS · REAL-TIME HACCP 165°F LOGGING
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Action Surface -->
          <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 bg-slate-50/60 dark:bg-obsidian-surface/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display mb-1">
                Explore the Live System
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">
                Test the interactive sandbox with pre-loaded census and recipe data.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
              <a
                href={DEMO_URL}
                class="py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-shoreline-600 hover:bg-shoreline-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <span>Launch Demo</span>
                <Icon name="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              </a>
              <a
                href="/pricing"
                class="py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-obsidian-border bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs font-semibold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors"
              >
                View Pricing
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
